        "objective": "Create src/ahra/alignment_session.py implementing a real Agent-driven\nAlignmentSessionManager per docs/architecture/intent-alignment-workflow.md\nand ADR-0009. It must:\n1. Accept an IntentDraft and drive multi-turn dialogue via the AgentDriver\n   port (src/ahra/ports.py) - do not import any model/cloud SDK directly.\n2. Keep immutable per-turn session state snapshots with turn history.\n3. Resolve profile/digest references from GoalOperationProfileRegistry and\n   reject unknown references with a structured error (never fabricate a digest).\n4. Emit an untrusted RequestDraft on convergence, never a frozen\n   GoalExecutionRequest.\n5. Be resumable from any state snapshot.\nAlso create tests/test_alignment_session.py with deterministic fake-AgentDriver\nfixtures asserting: agent-driven dialogue is actually invoked; unknown digest is\nrejected; resume-from-snapshot works; output is an untrusted RequestDraft.\nRun uv run python -B scripts/check.py --test and record it in\nWorkReport.verification_commands_run.\n",
